WEBVTT

00:03:56.315 --> 00:04:01.529
They'd baked as their way
of breaking the rules.

00:04:01.570 --> 00:04:06.325
They'd make batches of lemon bars
instead of casseroles

00:04:06.325 --> 00:04:08.411
or one-pot wonders.

00:04:08.411 --> 00:04:10.955
And they put those baked goods in baggies

00:04:10.955 --> 00:04:12.164
and hand them out,

00:04:12.206 --> 00:04:15.001
hand that magic out
to the most unassuming people.

00:04:15.001 --> 00:04:17.503
The newcomer to the neighborhood,

00:04:17.503 --> 00:04:19.505
the mail carrier or my personal favorite,

00:04:19.547 --> 00:04:21.674
the receptionist at the dentist office.

00:04:21.674 --> 00:04:23.467
(Laughs)

00:04:23.509 --> 00:04:28.431
Now I knew what the receiving end
of magic felt like

00:04:28.472 --> 00:04:30.099
from that Sugar Baby moment.